<title>UK: First Leisure first half profits slip.</title>
<headline>First Leisure first half profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to April 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.24		   vs 7.17</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.64		   vs 2.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax		    17.2		   vs 18.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   88.8		   vs 82.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 16.7 and 17.2 million stg. Earnings per share were before asset disposals. Profit before asset disposals was 16.6 million stg compared to 16.5 million stg last time.</p>
<p>Full company name - First Leisure Corp Plc</p>
</text>
